# Diagnostic route (no game data), run with --diagnostic-save-from-attempt 46
# (its month-end auto save holds a pending delayed event). Loading the auto
# slot runs AppData.Load -> DelayEvent.Deserialize (AppData.cs:2452-2459).
anchor timeout=2400
wait frames=110
key SELECT
wait frames=70
key UP
wait frames=20
key SELECT
wait frames=400
end
